Title: Multivariate Sum of Single Effects Regression
Description: Implements a multivariate generalization of the "Sum of
  Single Effects" (SuSiE) model for variable selection in multivariate
  linear regression as described in Y. Zou, P. Carbonetto, D. Xie, 
  G. Wang & M. Stephens (2026) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.8088040>.
